{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">FRAME-VALUE statement</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309537","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/FRAME-VALUE-statement.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/FRAME-VALUE-statement.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"FRAME-VALUE-statement\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">FRAME-VALUE statement</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Stores the value of an expression in a frame\nfield during a data entry statement.</p>\n      <div class=\"note note note_note\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> Does\nnot apply to SpeedScript programming.</div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"FRAME-VALUE-statement__syntax_GC17N82693003\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d28972e99\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"FRAME-VALUE-statement__idGDL2GL2670826\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>FRAME-VALUE = <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">\n            <p class=\"p\">A constant, field name, variable name or expression whose value\nyou want to store in a frame field. If no frame is active when the AVM\nruns this statement, the AVM returns an error message. Otherwise, if\nthe frame is in view, the AVM redisplays the field.</p>\n            <p class=\"p\">The data\ntype of the <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var> must be the same as the\ndata type of the frame field in which you are storing that expression.\nHowever, if the data type of <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var> is character,\nthe AVM stores characters in the frame field regardless of the data\ntype of that frame field, truncating characters if necessary.</p>\n            <p class=\"p\">The\nFRAME-VALUE statement can pass information from an <span class=\"ph filepath\">applhelp.p</span> procedure\nto the calling procedure. For example, if the user enters a value\ninto a field called help-field, you can pass that value back to\nthe calling procedure with this statement:</p>\n            <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"FRAME-VALUE-statement__idGDL2GM2670832\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n                  <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n                    <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                      <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>FRAME-VALUE = INPUT help-field.</code></pre>\n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                </tbody></table>\n          </dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"FRAME-VALUE-statement__example_GC17N92693014\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d28972e180\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure displays the word PROGRESS, the date, and a message instructing\nyou to enter data or press the <strong class=\"ph b keylabel\">GET</strong> key\nto enter the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>). You can update the information in\nthe frame. If you press GET, the <span class=\"ph filepath\">r-frmval.p</span> procedure assigns\nthe Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>) to a field with the FRAME-VALUE\nstatement.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-frmval.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"FRAME-VALUE-statement__idGDL2GN2670836\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE txt     AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO INITIAL &quot;PROGRESS&quot;.\nDEFINE VARIABLE tmpdate AS DATE      NO-UNDO INITIAL TODAY.\n\nIF KBLABEL(&quot;GET&quot;) = &quot;GET&quot; THEN ON F3 GET.\n\nSTATUS INPUT &quot;Enter data or use the &quot; + KBLABEL(&quot;GET&quot;)\n  + &quot; key to enter the Unknown value (?)&quot;.\n\nUPDATE txt tmpdate EDITING:\n  READKEY.\n  IF KEYFUNCTION(LASTKEY) = &quot;GET&quot; THEN DO:\n    <strong class=\"ph b\">FRAME-VALUE = ?.</strong>\n    NEXT.\n  END.\n  APPLY LASTKEY.\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"FRAME-VALUE-statement__note_GC17NA2693025\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d28972e230\">Note</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">For more\ninformation on frames, see <cite class=\"cite\">OpenEdge Getting Started: ABL Essentials</cite>.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"FRAME-VALUE-statement__see-also_GC17NB2693031\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d28972e242\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"FRAME-FIELD-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/FRAME-FIELD-function.html\">FRAME-FIELD function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"FRAME-FILE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/FRAME-FILE-function.html\">FRAME-FILE function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"FRAME-VALUE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/FRAME-VALUE-function.html\">FRAME-VALUE function</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"FRAME-VALUE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/FRAME-VALUE-function.html\">FRAME-VALUE function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"FUNCTION-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/FUNCTION-statement.html\">FUNCTION statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309537","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1470,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"FRAME-VALUE statement","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/FRAME-VALUE-statement.html","type":"Manual"}